  annotation = {中文辅助译名：宁夏农村地区癫痫患者心电图特征分析},
  abstract = {Objective To explore the characteristics of EEG in patients with epilepsy in Ningxia rural areas,to provide reference for the prevention and treatment of epilepsy.Methods Using cluster sampling method,210 patients with epilepsy of 4 counties were randomly selected from the free routine EEG and evoked experimental examination.EEG results were analyzed based on age,gender,genetic factors.Results(1) Of 210 patients,normal EEG in 30 copies,abnormal EEG in 180,the abnormal rate of EEG was 85.7%.(2) 84 patients showed epileptic discharge,accounting for 46.7%.58 patients showed temporal lobe epilepsy wave,accounted for 69%.(3) Abnormal rate of EEG was 92.7% in patients onset age under 14 while abnormal rate of EEG was 78% in patients onset age above 14(P0.01).Conclusion Abnormal rate of EEG is higher in patients with earlier onset age(under 14.EEG showed more temporal lobe epilepsy wave.},
}

